 OP traps of the game.\n\n--How to use?\nJUST ACTIVE IT. \n❗Important thing: will take some seconds to load the entire script (2-4 seconds)❗\n\n-- Why use this script?\nBecause this is the only one available and the only one that cancels all effect of the Love Struck Trap.\n❗It disable all effects of the trap, disable the camera rotation (the most annoying thing) and disable the slowness that give the trap.❗ (Everything about the trap)\n\n# made by AcelestuZ","tags":["Piggy","An*rap","AntiLovestruckTrap","AntiOPTrapPiggy","NoLovePiggyTrap"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"693ffd559b445894f4f7faeb","username":"AcelestuZ","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/598cf3a48c609f258923458b0b9812d736bbdbc025f46e8e1ce959f90733338a.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/693ffd559b445894f4f7faeb-1766412387069.png"},"status":"offline","id":"693ffd559b445894f4f7faeb","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/598cf3a48c609f258923458b0b9812d736bbdbc025f46e8e1ce959f90733338a.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/693ffd559b445894f4f7faeb-1766412387069.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-19T22:03:33.071Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"69c6d6bb9412c9ea8f3a9a10","editBy":{"_id":"693ffd559b445894f4f7faeb","username":"AcelestuZ","status":"offline","id":"693ffd559b445894f4f7faeb"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-03-27T19:12:59.509Z"}],"comments":[]}